  "title": "Neo-Concept International Group Holdings Limited Announces First Half 2025 Unaudited Financial Results",
  "summary": "Hong Kong, Nov. 21, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Neo-Concept International Group Holdings Limited (“NCI” or the “Company”) (NASDAQ: NCI), today announced its unaudited financial results for the six months ended June 30, 2025. Overview: Revenue was approximately HK$60.2 million (US$7.7 million) for the six months ended June 30, 2025, representing a decrease of approximately 24.0% […]",
